=== Building BFS vs PFS3 Benchmark ===
  Boot directory: build/benchmark/cpu-attribution-bfs-first/system
  Order: bfs-first
  Mode: deep-compare
Creating BFS partition (255.5 MiB)...
  BFS: build/benchmark/cpu-attribution-bfs-first/bench-bfs.hdf (256M)
Creating PFS3 partition (255.5 MiB)...
  PFS3: build/benchmark/cpu-attribution-bfs-first/bench-pfs3.hdf ( 80K)

=== Done ===

Test in FS-UAE: BFS_BENCH_RUN_DIR=build/benchmark/cpu-attribution-bfs-first ./emulator-test/run-bench.sh

For real hardware, create a single RDB image:
  Partition 1: FFS boot (copy build/benchmark/cpu-attribution-bfs-first/system contents)
  Partition 2: BFS 255.5 MiB (DosType 0x42465300)
  Partition 3: PFS3 255.5 MiB (DosType 0x50465303)
  Add bfshandler + pfs3aio to RDB filesystem entries
